Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:03.85,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sayın Muhtar…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:08.15,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:10.25,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni ortağınız.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:12.85,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalteri kapatıyoruz, tasarrufu paylaşıyoruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:14.10,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kazan kazan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:17.23,Alt,,0,0,0,,Öncekiler slayt getirmişti.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:22.13,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bakın, fatura burada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:23.88,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç yüz otuz üç bin—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.83,Alt,,0,0,0,,Koş Rıza, koş!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.83,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yetişemez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.73,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sayın Muhtar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:38.23,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtar Bey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.63,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bir dakika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:43.08,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ver bakayım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:46.63,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:48.53,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni… sahip…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.83,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sahip mi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:53.88,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalter Muhtar'da.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.18,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtar bende.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:56.63,Alt,,0,0,0,,Anahtar da burada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:58.18,Alt,,0,0,0,,Verir misiniz?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:00.43,Alt,,0,0,0,,Veririm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.63,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bir şartla.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:05.73,KutuKoyu,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1290)\frz2\fscx70\fscy70\t(0,140,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(140,220,\fscx100\fscy100)}EMİNE'NİN ŞARTI NE?
